flowchart LR
    A[事实层<br/>每次唤醒采样一次<br/>OS关联三态 / 0x59 / 端口活跃 / 拨号错误族 / USB/射频/前台] --> B[分类层<br/>WifiDialFailurePolicy 纯函数<br/>socketError+事实 → NoRoute/Refused/Timeout]
    B --> C[结果层<br/>WifiConnectResult<br/>TcpFailed 只留"关联在+拒连/超时"]
    C --> D[决策层<br/>WifiRecoveryMachine 纯内核<br/>只吃原因，决定动作与节拍]
    D --> E[执行层<br/>LinkRebuildPlan<br/>KeepSocket/RebuildDataPort/RebuildSockets/FullReconnect]
    E --> F[传输层<br/>三件套常驻 + 只换 socket + 定长缓冲]
    F --> A
